# Caviar design rules

Static GitHub Pages site. **Do not add a Tailwind/Vite/npm build** that must run at deploy time. Keep vanilla CSS (this repo) using a Tailwind-like 4px spacing scale, or commit a precompiled CSS file.

## References

- Spacing, type scale, utility rhythm: [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)
- Component anatomy, padding, and grid gaps: [shadcn/ui](https://ui.shadcn.com/) and [shadcn blocks](https://ui.shadcn.com/blocks) (hero, feature, pricing, FAQ, contact/form, navbar, footer)

## Palette

- Near-black ground `#070708`, elevated `#0E0E12`, surface `#14141A`
- Pearl `#F4F5F7`, silver `#C5CAD3`, platinum `#E8EAEE`, steel `#9AA3AE`
- **No gold, champagne, amber, or warm yellow**

## Layout

- Generous whitespace. Panels (service cards, pricing, process steps, work tiles, team, FAQ items) **never touch**. Use `--gap-panel` (16px mobile / 24px md / 32px lg).
- Each panel is a self-contained card: own border, own padding (`--pad-panel`), not a shared 1px divider between flush columns.
- Sharp corners (0–2px). Do not switch to pill CTAs or large rounded-xl SaaS cards.
- Slovak default, EN/DE in lockstep. No invented testimonials or numbers.

## Type

- Display: Cormorant Garamond. Body/UI: DM Sans.
- Feature headlines large; body 16–18px; labels uppercase with wide tracking.
